{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725410/extras/disclaimer_EN.png?t=1749510553\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725410/extras/teste.png?t=1749510553\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u0f04 In this demo, Thaynara and Leonardo set out on what seems like a simple mission: gather Lumina crystals from a Spiritual Zone nestled within Brazil\u2019s Teres\u00f3polis National Park. But something feels<strong> </strong>off<strong>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725410/extras/Tela_01.png?t=1749510553\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sensitive to the energy of the place, Thaynara ventures off alone to investigate\u2014and what she finds defies all the laws of the Shamans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover the beginning of a mystery that bridges the physical and spiritual worlds in this stylish and intense journey through <strong><i>Lumina \u2013</i></strong><i> <strong>The Uprising Of Folk Legends.</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>| Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725410/extras/Sequ\u00eancia_01_2.gif?t=1749510553\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u0f04\u00a0An action RPG that blends fast-paced combat with exploration in a world where spirituality and progress collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u0f04 Face formidable enemies in intense battles, master stylish combos, and unleash powerful abilities alongside Guardian Spirits, each with their own personality and combat style. Develop your skills, upgrade automata, and unravel the mysteries of Shamanism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725410/extras/Sequ\u00eancia_01.gif?t=1749510553\" /><strong><i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0At the end of this journey, what will remain: hope or destruction?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725410/extras/osso_com_glow_maior_-_Copia.png?t=1749510553\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3725410?t=1749510553","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725410/7aa3bdd49f674ca9dd05340476133e94cf1b14d0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749510553","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725410/f4122610162126860b6ef18168cb8ab51bf3738c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749510553","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725410/f4122610162126860b6ef18168cb8ab51bf3738c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749510553","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725410/extras/disclaimer_EN.png?t=1749510553\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725410/extras/teste.png?t=1749510553\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u0f04 In this demo, Thaynara and Leonardo set out on what seems like a simple mission: gather Lumina crystals from a Spiritual Zone nestled within Brazil\u2019s Teres\u00f3polis National Park. But something feels<strong> </strong>off<strong>.</strong></p><p class=